#: contests/templates/graph.html:31
msgctxt "graph-about"
msgid ""
"The graph below displays the evolution of scores received by the top 9 "
"participants during the wikicontest. This graph is generated automatically "
"and does not constitute a final or official ranking. Please note that "
"organizers may reevaluate previous edits, and the displayed points may be "
"recalculated without prior notice. In case of discrepancy, only the table "
"inserted by the organizers of the wikicontest on their official page should "
"be considered."
msgstr ""
"Grafik di bawah menampilkan evolusi skor yang diterima oleh 9 peserta "
"teratas selama ajang wiki. Grafik ini dihasilkan otomatis dan bukanlah "
"pemeringkatan akhir atau resmi. Mohon ingat bahwa penyelenggara dapat "
"menilai ulang suntingan sebelumnya, dan poin yang tertampil dapat dihitung "
"ulang tanpa pemberitahuan lebih dulu. Jika terjadi perbedaan, hanya tabel "
"yang disediakan penyelenggara ajang wiki di halaman resmi mereka yang harus "
"dipertimbangkan."

#: contests/templates/graph.html:49
msgctxt "graph-axis"
msgid "Ranking of the top 9 participants by elapsed day"
msgstr "Pemeringkatan 9 peserta teratas berdasarkan hari yang berlalu"

